    12	# Design analysis for the D8/2 + D17/2 combo
    13	# ------------------------------------------
    14	# a) Concrete behavior:
    15	#    - The legend keeps the original 6x24 format, but the main grid is no longer "several unrelated
    16	#      one-off blockers". Instead there are exactly four blockers arranged as a symmetric box around
    17	#      the teal square:
    18	#        * one horizontal pair above/below the square
    19	#        * one vertical pair left/right of the square
